A. Every annual license fee shall include a nonrefundable portion in an amount equal to twenty-five percent (25%) of the prescribed license fee or Twenty-five Dollars ($25.00), which-ever is greater. The remainder of the license fee shall be refundable only as allowed in subsection B of this section.

