1. "Hamburger" or "ground beef thirty percent (30%) maximum fat;
2. "Lean ground beef" twenty-three percent (23%) maximum fat;
3. "Extra lean ground beef" sixteen percent (16%) maximum fat;
4. "Leanest ground beef" nine percent (9%) maximum fat.

D. Additional Pork Sausage Adulterants. In addition to the adulterants specified in Sections 10.13.030 A and 10.13.240 B of this chapter, pork sausage shall be deemed to be adulterated when containing MPRAF or MPRAF products other than pork.

