12A.12.050 Attendance at an unlawful race event

A. No person shall attend an unlawful race event. Attendance at an unlawful race event consists of:

1. Actual or constructive knowledge of being in attendance of an unlawful race event;

2. Actual or constructive knowledge that an unlawful race event is occurring;

