The Special Events Committee shall have the power:

A. To interpret and administer this Chapter 15.52, to establish criteria for determining whether an event meets the definition of a special event, to determine whether an event requires a special event permit, to determine the special event type, to calculate the special events fee, and to require, receive, and process applications for such permits;

B. To represent the City, under the supervision of the Mayor, in discussions and in making agreements with persons who propose an event that may require a special event permit;

