C. Drawings of the proposed skybridge showing its visual appearance;

D. Photographs of the location and immediately surrounding area;

E. A copy of the environmental checklist or determination of exemption as required by Sections 25.05.315 and 25.05.960;

F. A statement of the reasons for the necessity of the proposed skybridge and intended use, including whether the skybridge is intended for general public use or more limited private use;

