SPECIAL REVIEW DISTRICT 23.66.304

Special Review District is established to promote, preserve and perpetuate the cultural, economic, historical, and otherwise beneficial qualities of the area, particularly the features derived from its Asian heritage, by:

A. Reestablishing the District as a stable residential neighborhood with a mixture of housing types;

