A. All proposed development subject to this Chapter 25.09 is required to document use of mitigation sequencing in this Section 25.09.065 when needed to protect the ecological functions of steep slope erosion hazard areas and their buffers, wetlands, wetland buffers, fish and wildlife habitat conservation areas, and flood-prone areas.

B. Mitigation sequencing

1. Mitigation measures shall be undertaken in the following order of priority:

   a. Avoiding the impact altogether by not taking a certain action or parts of an action;

25-141

