1. Existing topography at 2 foot contour intervals on site, on adjacent lands within 25 feet of the site’s property lines, and on the full width of abutting public and private rights-of-way and easements;

2. Terrain and stormwater-flow characteristics within the site, on adjacent sites within 25 feet of the site’s property lines, and on the full width of abutting public and private rights-of-way and easements;

